The files in this directory are OpenDrive's official API sample code — PHP, C#
and JavaScript — republished here unchanged, under the MIT licence OpenDrive
publishes them with.

They are not part of the OpenDrive Bridge codebase and are not compiled into it.
They are kept because they are the only place some of the upload protocol's
sequencing is written down at all: the four-step chunked upload was read out of
test_file_upload_chunked.php before it was confirmed on the wire.

OpenDrive's REST API Guide — the PDF — is a different matter and is *not* in this
repository. Its copyright page forbids reproducing or transmitting it in any
form. See ../official-api-reference.md.

